# custom

# Anchored to the repo root. Unanchored, `archive/` matches at ANY depth, and it
# silently swallowed apps/dataplane/archive/ -- a real source package (mongo.py,
# 54 KB) that apps/dataplane/service.py imports at line 441. `git status` never
# showed it, so the dataplane could not run from a clone at all. There is no
# top-level archive/ directory, so anchoring loses nothing.
/archive/
results/
output/
notebook/
dataset/
log/
nohup*
datahub/
run_logs/

# Container-logistics scenarios live in a global folder outside the domain package
# (openride_apps/scenarios/). Commit the SOURCES (spec.json, scenario_gen.py, inputs/);
# ignore the derived, regenerable COMPILE ARTIFACTS (rebuild with `compile-scenario`).
scenarios/_index.json
scenarios/_registry.json
scenarios/*/scenario.json
scenarios/*/index.json
scenarios/**/*.tmp


# user_db.py
.DS_Store

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
